        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Proverbs 5:6",
        "book": "Proverbs",
        "chapter": 5,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "Hear me now therefore, O ye children, and depart not from the words of my mouth.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 7,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Proverbs 5:7",
        "book": "Proverbs",
        "chapter": 5,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "Remove thy way far from her, and come not nigh the door of her house:",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 6,
            "text": "Alma 39:9 (9–11)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Proverbs 5:8",
        "book": "Proverbs",
        "chapter": 5,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "Lest thou give thine honour unto others, and thy years unto the cruel:",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Proverbs 5:9",
        "book": "Proverbs",
        "chapter": 5,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "Lest strangers be filled with thy wealth; and thy labours be in the house of a stranger;",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 34,
            "end": 40,
            "text": "OR strength."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 58,
            "end": 60
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Proverbs 5:10",
        "book": "Proverbs",
        "chapter": 5,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "And thou mourn at the last, when thy flesh and thy body are consumed,",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 11,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Proverbs 5:11",
        "book": "Proverbs",
        "chapter": 5,
        "verse": 11
      },
      {
        "text": "And say, How have I hated instruction, and my heart despised reproof;",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 26,
            "end": 37,
            "text": "D&C 101:5 (1–5)."
